<p>Hits the target doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">189%, 226%, 254%, 278%, 300%</acronym> weapon damage. This attack cannot miss, and ignores all armor and resistances on the target. However, you take damage equal to 25% of the damage dealt, or 30% of your current HP, whichever is lower.</p>